01:08:45,000 --> 01:08:51,000
Junior Bonner is a 1972 American contemporary Western film directed by Sam Peckinpah and
starring Steve McQueen, Robert Preston, Joe Don Baker, and Ida Lupino.

12
01:15:00,000 --> 01:15:06,000
The film focuses on a veteran rodeo rider as he returns to his hometown of Prescott, Arizona, to
participate in an annual rodeo competition and reunite with his brother and estranged parents.

13
